itle game","description":"Rasean Jones caught 11 passes for 230 yards and 3 TDs to help No. 24 Boise State outlast Oregon State 46-41 and wrap up the host spot in the Pac-12 title game.","published":"2026-11-15T03:30:08.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50486399/boise-state-outlasts-oregon-state-host-pac-12-title-game","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"No. 16 Oregon keeps CFP hopes alive with win over Michigan","description":"Dylan Raiola threw for 341 yards and four touchdowns, and No. 16 Oregon kept its slim chances for a spot in the College Football Playoff alive with a victory over struggling Michigan on Saturday.","published":"2026-11-15T03:15:15.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50485510/no16-oregon-keeps-cfp-hopes-alive-win-michigan","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Wake Forest's post-blowout jab at SMU tops college football Week 11 trolls","description":"Wake Forest dominated SMU on the gridiron Saturday -- and added insult to injury after the game.","published":"2026-11-15T00:54:02.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50481104/college-football-trolls-week-11","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Grant Wilson delivers as Indiana boosts CFP, Big Ten hopes with win vs. USC","description":"With Grant Wilson filling in at quarterback, No. 9 Indiana ramped up its offensive attack against USC and scored its best win of the season Saturday.","published":"2026-11-15T03:22:32.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50485076/grant-wilson-indiana-boost-cfp-big-ten-hopes-win-vs-usc","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Watch best moments and top plays live from Week 11","published":"2026-11-15T01:00:42.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50474063/week-11-live-highlights","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Darian Mensah dices up ex-team Duke as Miami rebounds from first loss","description":"Miami quarterback Darian Mensah diced up his former team Saturday, finishing with 382 yards and a touchdown in the 36-25 victory over Duke.","published":"2026-11-14T23:57:48.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50484151/darian-mensah-dices-ex-team-duke-miami-rebounds-first-loss","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Wake Forest strengthens CFP case with 'statement' win at SMU","description":"No. 13 Wake Forest made a statement to the College Football Playoff selection committee with a 49-7 blowout of SMU on Saturday.","published":"2026-11-15T00:41:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50483729/wake-forest-strengthens-cfp-case-statement-win-smu","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4921108/desean-bishop","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DeSean_Bishop"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"DeSean Bishop","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DeSean_Bishop","description":"American football player (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:36:30Z","intro":"DeSean Bishop (born October 15, 2004) is an American college football running back for the Tennessee Volunteers.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Bishop played running back for Karns High School where he recorded 8,347 rushing yards and 102 rushing touchdowns. On July 14, 2022, Bishop committed to continue his playing career at Coastal Carolina, but decommitted after head coach Jamey Chadwell was hired by Liberty. On December 21, 2022, Bishop decided to join the Tennessee Volunteers as a preferred walk-on."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"During his true freshman year, Bishop did not play in any games and took a redshirt after suffering an injury during the preseason.\nDuring the 2024 season, Bishop served as the second-string running back behind All-SEC selection Dylan Sampson. Despite facing injuries in the later weeks of the season, Bishop was able to accumulate 455 yards and three touchdowns on 74 carries.\nIn January 2025, Bishop was given a football scholarship. He finished the 2025 season with 182 carries for 1,076 rushing yards and 16 rushing touchdowns."}]}}